# ask_to_be_led — fail
#
# The poultry keeper trades from the farm's Storage Shed, and at location id 1 spends the afternoon at
# the Duck Pond — met there, she is a trader off her premises, which is the only place the verb is
# offered. --npc-affinity because the verb sits behind the introduction; --auto-dialogue settles the
# conversation it opens, so the assertion is about the verb. Where it leads is the outcome's test
# (cli/outcome/led_to_premises/).
#
# The real farm rather than the test location: there every person trades wherever they stand, so a
# trader is never off their premises and this verb is offered on nobody.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --npc-affinity CloseFriend --location-type farm --location-id 1 --start-area "Duck Pond" --period afternoon --observe-only "poultry_keeper"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy fail-dice
goal ask_to_be_led
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180

click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect FAILURE
expect-verb ask_to_be_led
quit
